# Goop readback (GXSetCopyReadback, Aurora patch 0013), dolpic/0. S0=(712,330,4631) is on goop (route 94).
# Spray while standing (R held, the nozzle points at the ground in front), then stand on points ahead.
# Per layer every 10 ticks: [hplog-map] raw map byte / isPolluted at d=0..450 along the facing; [hplog-pol] dirty=.
# Env: SUNSHINE_DEV_START=dolpic/0 SUNSHINE_DEV_SKIP_MOVIES=1 SUNSHINE_DEV_HPLOG=1.
waitfor director mario dirstate=4 camDemo=0 timeout=3000
wait frames=60
cheat infinite_health
cheat infinite_water
tp x=712 y=330 z=4631 yaw=0
wait frames=40
log
shot rb_before.png
hold trig=0,255 frames=150
wait frames=10
log
shot rb_spray_end.png
wait frames=60
log
tp x=712 y=330 z=4691 yaw=0
wait frames=40
log
tp x=712 y=330 z=4751 yaw=0
wait frames=40
log
shot rb_on_patch.png
tp x=712 y=330 z=4831 yaw=0
wait frames=40
log
tp x=712 y=330 z=5031 yaw=0
wait frames=40
log
shot rb_after.png
wait frames=30
end
